		<li><strong>Comprehensive Insurance Policies:</strong> Going beyond GST compliant insurance, packers and movers can offer comprehensive insurance policies for added protection. These policies cover both accidental damage and non-accidental damage, ensuring a more extensive risk coverage for your goods.</li>
		<li><strong>IRDAI-Approved Marine Transit Insurance:</strong> If your household goods contain valuable items like furniture, electronics, or antiques, opting for IRDAI-approved marine transit insurance can safeguard your belongings. IRDAI is the Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India, ensuring the credibility of the insurance provider.</li>
	</ul>

	<p>By availing these risk coverage options, you can enjoy a hassle-free relocation experience with peace of mind. It is always advisable to discuss the available insurance options with the packer and mover company and choose the most suitable coverage for your belongings.</p></div>
